OL,3,GNEWSATeenager falls into bonfire after
OL,4,Abeing punched
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy fell into a bonfire after
OL,7,Fbeing punched and knocked unconscious
OL,8,Fin County Tyrone at the weekend.
OL,10,FThe 17-year-old was attending the
OL,11,Fbonfire in the Bradley Way area of
OL,12,FStrabane on Saturday when he was
OL,13,Fattacked at around 22:35 GMT.
OL,15,FThe police have commended a woman who
OL,16,F"bravely" pulled the boy to safety.
OL,18,F"This was a reckless and dangerous act,
OL,19,Fan assault which has left the victim
OL,20,Fwith injuries," said a spokesperson for
OL,21,Fthe Police Service of Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
